{"asset_key":"ep9/quest_story_19105130","episode":"ep9","category":"quest_story","story_id":"19105130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1910513001:1":{"text":"수심이 또 깊어졌어! 아까 파도 장로가 그 소리에 반응하고 잠수하기 시작했다고 했지?","source_cn":"深度又下降了五尺！你刚才说，波涛长者回应了声音，然后才...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1C34072A78F74C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1910513002:1":{"text":"아니, 파도 장로가 먼저 잠수하고 나서 한숨 소리가 들린 것 같아. 발밑이 흔들린 다음에 소리가 들렸거든.","source_cn":"不，我觉得是波涛长者先下潜，然后叹息才响起的，因为我先...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED9249B60127C1C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1910513003:1":{"text":"톱니상어가 암초에 머리를 들이받은 것처럼 엄청나게 컸다고! 그걸 어떻게 못 듣지?","source_cn":"那声音简直像锯齿鲨一头撞上礁石——那么响亮，你怎么会没听到？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x54D405DDA3D3A5E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1910513004:1":{"text":"아무것도 못 들었는데...","source_cn":"我什么也没听到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x39668AD7985CFED6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1910513005:1":{"text":"파도 장로가 뭔가 전하려고 하는 걸까? 그래서 그렇게 크게 운 걸지도 몰라.","source_cn":"难道波涛长者想要告诉我们什么？那可能是它的宏声吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A737DC1474B57E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","doc